── not repointed, and why ──
  · Tasks  · scripts/design/interaction-check.mjs and verify-tasks.mjs drive the
             lab file by state through the CONSOLE's own harness (window.__signal
             plus the customizer shell). They can be pointed at the master, but
             the console does not exist here, so what they would grade is a
             different page. verify.mjs §3 and §4 drive the composed file
             directly instead, in the suite's own vocabulary.
  · Notes  · scripts/design/notes-interaction-check.mjs, same reason.
  · Timeline · interaction-check.mjs (845 assertions) is written against the lab
             master's ELEVEN states as separate page loads. In the suite the
             artifact is one product among three and ?state= reaches it, so this
             one is genuinely repointable — it is the largest single piece of
             outstanding verification and it is on BUILD-LIST.md, not done.

